Output demo/demo.gif

Require go

Set Shell "bash"
Set FontSize 42
Set Width 3600
Set Height 2200
Set Padding 50

Hide
Type "CALENDAR_DEMO=1 go run ."
Enter
Sleep 2s
Show

Sleep 3s
Right@1s 4
Sleep 1s
Left@1s 4
Sleep 1s
Type "n"
Sleep 2s
Type "Calendar in your Terminal"
Sleep 4s

Hide
Type "q"
Sleep 1s
